## Cloudflare DNS

This box may have a zone-scoped Cloudflare DNS API token at `/home/{{USERNAME}}/.cloudflare/token`.

- Use it only for the Cloudflare zone configured for this Dev Boxer host.
- Cloudflare zone: `{{CF_ZONE_NAME}}`
- It is intended for creating and updating DNS records for project subdomains.
- Do not print, commit, or transmit the token.
- Prefer proxied CNAME records to the existing Cloudflare Tunnel target when exposing local web projects.
- If the token file is missing, ask the user whether DNS is manual before trying to create records.

The main tunnel hostnames are:

- `{{CF_HOSTNAME_MAIN}}`
- `{{CF_HOSTNAME_MATRIX}}`
- `{{CF_HOSTNAME_VIEWER}}`

